      <title>Shrinkwrap 0.24.2</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>Wide-gamut images keep their color. Display P3 sources — iPad art, iPhone photos — now come out tagged and unclipped in PNG, JPEG, WebP and AVIF, instead of being quietly flattened to sRGB. Retag a folder to re-render existing wide-gamut outputs.</p>]]></description>
